window.products.push({"id":1026099,"name":"GAViA S Hooks, S Shaped Hooks, Matte Black S Hooks Heavy Duty for Hanging Pots and Pans, Plants, Coffee Cups, Coats, Bags, Towels in Kitchen, Bedroom,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TVHU9jmVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【HIGH QUALITY S HOOKS】: Made of 6063 SPACE ALUMINUM which is same as the material of supercars and airplanes, makes it sturdy and light weight. And anodized to ensure s hook durable, rust resistant, corrosion resistant. 【SIZE and WEIGHT: S Hooks size】: 3.4\"H x 1.88\"W, small opening is 0.6 inches, large opening is 1 inches, 0.22 inches of thickness, fit MAX 1\" diameter shelves, bars, rods and racks. Hanging weight up to 55 lbs or 25kgs. You can use s hooks for hanging your heavy pots and pans. 【PRACTICAL AND EFFICIENT ORGANIZER】: GAViA heavy duty S shaped hooks provide a practical organized solution for your kitchen just by hanging your pots, pans, spatulas, cups, and other kitchen utensils on your pot rack, bar, wall rails or shelves, make everything more convenient and neat. And tidy up your closet by hanging clothes, jeans, scarfs, hats, belts, jewelry and more. Also organize tools in the garage, hang toiletries, towels in the bathroom and hang plants in your garden. 【MULTIFUNCITIONAL S HOOKS】: These s hanging hooks are used indoors and outdoors, used in closet, bedroom, workshop, garage, office or hanging plant basket, chime, lantern outdoor where space is limited. It doesn’t need to drill on your beautiful house and wall, just hang items on racks, bars, shelves, without need of nails, screws, or adhesives. Easy to pack and remove, no track left. 【WELL MADE & STYLISH】: S-hooks with round ends design, smooth polishing, no sharp ends without worrying about scratching your hands or items. Sleek design on each end ensures hanging items securely without falling or slipping off. 5.5mm (0.22\") thick S hooks for heavy duty hanging. Classic Matte Black S hooks are eco-friendly coating, effectively solves fingerprints and accumulation of dust. 【BUY WITH CONFIDENCE:】 Try them today and buy with confidence with our simple, hassle-free,100% MONEY BACK SATISFACTION! Tough, durable construction and fine workmanship. Click the \"Add to Cart\" button to order. Package: 10 * Black S Hooks","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TVHU9jmVS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"GAViA","source_asin":"B0895B6Y48","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026099","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0895B6Y48","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0895B6Y48","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
