window.products.push({"id":1026101,"name":"Pillow Covers 18 x 18 Set of 2 Throw Pillow Covers Outdoor Furniture Pillow Cases 45cm x 45cm for Outdoor Sofa Bed Home Decor (Colorful Flamingo)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FPLZulckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"The story of Merle Pillow covers I'm a pillows lover. I've bought many different kinds of pillow covers, so I can change my pillows decor from season to season.  However, I always feel that it is not perfect, because the pillow covers what I bought are all one side printed, the side without printing affects the appearance.  Later, I contacted an Italian designer to design double-side printed throw pillow covers.  The Italian designer gave me a lot of advice, and designed a lot of beautiful patterns of pillowcases.  I want to share the beautiful pillow covers with people who have the same troubles, Merle pillow covers, Double side printed pillow covers, Beautiful pillow covers. The pillow covers are made of high quality short pile fabric, soft and light, very comforta. The beautiful Pattern perfect for home decoration,  brings enjoyment to the host. Specification: Includes: 2 pcs pillow covers only, inserts are not included. Material: Short Pile Fabric. Dimension: 17.7 x 17.7 inches, Suit for20”x20” (50 x 50 cm) pillow inserts. Zipper: Hidden zipper closure Wash instruction: 1. Can hand wash and machine wash, wash in cold water or 30℃ water.  2. Do not bleach. 3. Dry flat or hand to dry.  4. Vivid colors & Clear image.  5. No Fading How to fill the pillow covers with inserts: 1.Open the cover zipper.  2.Fold the pillow insert in half.  3.Fill the insert into the pillow cover.  4.Unfold the pillow.  5.Close the pillow cover zipper. Kindly Remind: 1.Pillow covers only, inserts are not included.  2.Please allow 1 inch deviation exist due to handmade.  3.There are slight difference between the picture and the real item caused by light brightness.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71FPLZulckL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Merle","source_asin":"B0957SDDKH","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026101","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0957SDDKH","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0957SDDKH","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
