window.products.push({"id":1026269,"name":"DB DEGBIT Portable Fast Heat-Up Steamer for Clothes, Handheld Travel Garment Steamer, Powerful Wrinkle Remover with 360°Anti-Leak, 100% Safe Auto-Off ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qLZwEv4oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Fast & Effective Wrinkle Remover Imported 👔【New Clothes, New You】 Do you really want to use an old, musty ironing board to freshen up your business attire? Do you want to risk staining your new dress with a potentially dirty or broken iron? No way! So get a Degbit Steamer! Our portable steamer is a compact, travel-friendly tool that allows you to easily get rid of wrinkles anywhere! Ready to go in just 25 seconds and holds up to 100ml of water for 8-10 minutes of continuous steaming power. Removes wrinkles in the blink of an eye! 👔【Don't Like Heavy and Inconvenient Irons】 Try our upgrade travel steamer now! It’s travel-sized, lightweight, and easy to pack and store. Stow it snugly in your suitcase for a quick, convenient way to keep clothes looking perfect on the go. The hand-held steamer is also the quickest way to de-wrinkle at home. Its one-touch button activation makes it easy to operate on one hand, and its detachable water reservoir makes it a breeze to clean and refill. 👔【Get Rid of Wrinkles Without Getting Clothes Wet】The garment steamer is 100% leakproof, no matter how you hold it. It features a sophisticated heating system that guarantees it will never spit or sputter out hot water guaranteeing that you and your clothes remain dry and pristine. What’s more, this steamer is a great way to get wrinkles out of tough or delicate fabrics such as cotton, wool, polyester, silk, nylon, velvet or linen. 👔【Your Safety is Always Our Top Priority】Degbit clothing steamer comes designed with an auto power-off function which shuts down the steamers whenever low water levels are detected in order to protect you, your home, and the longevity of your steamer. Also, unlike other irons and steamers, our handheld steamer’s unique 360° anti-leak functionality allows you to de-wrinkle clothes from all angles, vertically or horizontally, with your safety guaranteed. 👔【The Risk-Free Guarantee】While our focus is always on cutting edge technology, our first priority is always the customer experience. Because we are confident in our product and your satisfaction, we are proud to say that we always offer a 100% money-back guarantee and a LIFETIME warranty on each order. If you ever need any help, feel free to conatct us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61qLZwEv4oL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"DB DEGBIT","source_asin":"B07MTXR8TX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026269","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07MTXR8TX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07MTXR8TX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
