window.products.push({"id":1026472,"name":"Mamba 9V Electric Herb Grinder. Battery Powered One-Handed Mill for Herbs & Fine Leaf. Rocker Switch for Easy & Rapid Product Grinding in a Snap (Anch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nKsM2oahS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"🌿 YOUR FAVORITE HERB: No matter how leafy, mossy or oily, easily deliver ground herb product with the Mamba Electric Grinder’s powered teeth. A sleek body with stylish colors and anodized metal heads. With one handed use – get blasted into ingredient preparation 🌿 LOAD–CLOSE–GRIND! Lay flat and load-up just to its 1g capacity, close and press for a medium to fine grind, then point and dispense with no contamination or spillages of expensive product. Complete with cleaning pick tools NB. Not suitable for hard nuts, shells, pepper corns or beans 🌿 CHOP & EXTRACT: It gets the hard work done. Just alternate the Rocker Switch in both forward and reverse directions for texture and consistency, and to prevent any jams or clogging. Without the strain or cramp, gain therapeutic benefits for infirm hands with limited mobility and strength 🌿 BATTERY POWERED: A standard 9V battery powers a speed up to 20x faster than hand grinder. The upper and lower grinding heads are precision milled from aluminum alloy with offset-curved razor sharp teeth that cut and push without clumping up NB. Battery not included 🌿 THE RIGHT GRIND – AT THE RIGHT TIME! The Mamba Team’s designs and testing has led to a Battery Grinder that unlocks your herb’s flavour, distinctive aroma, and potency - all at the push of a button. See the Mamba Team on-line by searching for our original electric herb grinder Kickstarter video","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71nKsM2oahS._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Mamba","source_asin":"B08VJ87X49","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026472","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08VJ87X49","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08VJ87X49","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026473,"name":"ZAFRO Electric Fireplace Stove, Electric Fireplace Heater with Adjustable Brightness, Indoor Fireplace with Realistic Flame Effects, Space Fireplace w","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f+YEI6d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【ANCIENT EUROPEAN ARTISTIC DESIGN & ALL-STEEL STRUCTURE】- The door of ZAFRO Electric Fireplace stove is featured with the design of medieval ancient European church. At the same time, our electric flame heater adopts a unique all-steel structure design, which increases the service life of our fireplace. It’s an ideal choice for you to choose our electric heater for office, home, bathroom, bedroom, kitchen, living room, etc. 【MULTICOLOR REALISTIC FLAME EFFECTS & THREE SIDES VIEW】- Our space heater is designed with 4-color flame and crystal combination change create an incredibly realistic & colorful effects (The color range from traditional single color, double color to multi color). And high-intensity LED lights with large display allows the flame to \"burn\" high enough, flames emerge slowly from the \"source\" and then get pulled to the top of the fireplace where they flash in the heat of the top of the fireplace stove. 【5-FLAME BRIGHTNESS & SPEED】- ZAFRO Fireplace Heater with 5-flame brightness and 5-flame speed setting that ranges from a dull ember glow to a full blazing light lets you adjust the flames depending on your individual needs for brightness and speed. Meanwhile, the flame effect works with or without heat, so you can enjoy it any time, even during warm spring or summer nights when added heat isn't necessary. 【LOW NOISE & LED DISPLAY PANEL】- Compared to similar indoor fireplace, Our freestanding fireplace produce less noise (≤32dB), protecting you from annoying distractions no matter what you're doing. Meanwhile, the LED display panel of our electric fireplace heater could make you more easily to set modes, flame speed and brightness, timer, etc. 【SAFETY COOL TOUCH & OVERHEATING PROTECTION】- Infrared quartz heat helps to maintain the natural humidity in the air, resulting in comfortable warmth without drying out the room’s air. Safety temperature overheat cut off switch and durable stay-cool fire-retardant metal frame. The air outlet at the top of the electric fireplace stove which can effectively avoid overheating and high temperature hazard of the fuselage.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71f+YEI6d1L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ZAFRO","source_asin":"B0BN63MHJQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026473","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BN63MHJQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BN63MHJQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
