window.products.push({"id":1026620,"name":"REJORIO Gray Duvet Cover Set Soft Microfiber Textured Bedding Sets Jacquard Tufted Embroidery Shabby Chic Bedding Duvet Covers California King All Sea","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":35.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rcr8lIj-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【SIMPLE STYLE】-- Our tufted king duvet cover set presents a minimalist geometric grid pattern, simple style. perfect for your bedroom decor and easy to match with other styles【HIDDEN ZIPPER】-- this grey duvet cover features a hidden zipper closure ties to ensure your duvet, quilt or down comforter away from shifting【PREMIUM FABRIC】-- The king duvet cover set is made of premium microfiber fabric, soft, breathable, wrinkle free, skin-friendly and pilling resistant. cozy to sleep on【EASY TO CARE】-- Hand washable or machine washable. gentle cycle only. use only non-chlorine bleach. tumble dry on low heat. iron on low heat. do not dry clean【PACKAGE CONTENT】-- You will get 1 duvet cover and 2 matching pillowcase. comforter and pillows are not included","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71Rcr8lIj-L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"REJORIO","source_asin":"B09PDM23HR","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026620","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09PDM23HR","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09PDM23HR","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026621,"name":"Pluto Produkter Goldfish Rotary Candleholder","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jmruE7rXL._AC_.jpg","description":"When the included tea light candle is lit in the base of the rotary candle holder, the heat of the candle will make the goldfish and the carousel spin, and shaped reflections move around the ceiling. Comes nicely presented in a box ideal as a gift. Remarkably sophisticated with just a touch of whimsy, this goldfish candle holder is a wonderful way to bring smiles with a unique display of entertainment in motion! Each of our stunning rotary candle holders is crafted from durable metal with a beautiful silver finish. Just position the flickering tea light candle (included), and within moments the heat from the flame will set the art in motion. You can add your own scented tea light and indulge in your favorite aroma. These Änglaspel are designed in and imported from Sweden. They are contemporary versions of the traditional candle chimes. Because these were designed to actually rotate and cast beautiful shadows, the metal is thin, and the item light-weight. Some of the competing rotary candle holders you will see have less detail (especially in shadow), and 4 clappers rather than our 6. When you see the Pluto Produkter AB as the manufacturer and PlutoGifts as the merchant, you can be confident of high quality and wonderful attention to detail. In order to see the hundred different choices from Pluto Produkter AB just type \"rotary candleholder\" in the search box above. For those of us who grew up with them, rotary candle holders are a seasonal blend of light and motion. They belong to a purely domestic and old-fashioned type of joy, one that emphasizes a dark room over a brightly lit one (to appreciate the dancing interplay of light and shadow); and calm over activity (so that stray air currents shouldn’t disrupt the workings). Darkness, stillness, silence: all inescapable aspects of the northern winter, and it is therefore not surprising that candleholders are such an enduring tradition.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31jmruE7rXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Pluto Produkter","source_asin":"B003D4X9A8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026621","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B003D4X9A8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B003D4X9A8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
