window.products.push({"id":1026640,"name":"Blasting Monster Truck Childrens Wall Art - Personalise the number plate (Medium 78cm(W) X 60cm(H)) by Loud Designs","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+yAyt8d+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"All of our vinyl wall art are hand crafted using high quality exterior grade self-adhesive matt or gloss vinyl. They are not printed and will have no unsightly white border around the image like others you may see. They are suitable for applying onto painted/papered interior walls, exterior walls, garage doors, glass, cars/vans/boats, tiles, ceramics, canvas, ceilings, and much much more. Each Wall Art comes with a FREE test decal to try before your main decal. Colours are sent in matt, all colours are also available in gloss please add message whilst paying or email us stating you require gloss. Size: Please check the size, if this is not what you are looking for then just contact us with your size request and we can help you. The picture above shows our largest size we offer, please see the description for the size offered in this listing as it may differ. Postage: Your Vinyl Wall Art is shipped in strong cardboard tube and will be sent 1st class Royal Mail. You will also get instructions on how to put up the wall art, but if you need help telephone support is available. We are very interested in seeing your wall art in your own homes, please contact us with a picture and we will show off your wall art work on our facebook page.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81+yAyt8d+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Loud Designs","source_asin":"B00BK6YUCC","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026640","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00BK6YUCC","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00BK6YUCC","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026641,"name":"Michel Design Works Decorative Throw Pillow, 18 x 18, Paradise, Square","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cS8r9zsoL._AC_.jpg","description":"These charming printed square throw pillows are the perfect way to refresh a room. They are trimmed with jute piping and filled with hypoallergenic polyester down inserts. Hidden zipper for easy closure. Covers are 100-percent cotton and made in the USA. Hand wash with warm water. Michel Design Works was created by Bruce & Deborah Michel in the early 1980s. The first product was an elaborate \"memory book\" called Our Country Diary. Still a favorite today, it is filled with vintage artwork, quirky quotes, notable dates and plenty of room to record all the events of the year. Our Country Diary will become a beautiful record of your family life. When they first created their signature elephant logo, it signified a remembrance of all things special. Although Michel Design Works has greatly expanded into bath & body, home fragrance and decor, when Bruce & Deborah remember and celebrate all of their wonderful customers and the company's history, it is even more fitting today! Whether you are a new or a long-time friend, we welcome you to enjoy the art, lather up with our English soaps, set an elegant table with napkins, candles, plates, and serveware, and end your day with wonderfully fragrant bubble bath.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51cS8r9zsoL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Michel Design Works","source_asin":"B01N703YLD","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026641","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01N703YLD","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01N703YLD","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
