window.products.push({"id":1026648,"name":"Pure Garden 50-10008 Set of Two Hedyotis Topiary Plants, 17x17, Green","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":115.47,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TrmmbsUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Bring a bit of greenery to your lawn or home with the Set of Two Hedyotis Topiaries by Pure Garden. These faux trees are great for busy folks who want a bit of greenery in their garden or home, but don’t have time to care for living plants. The branches and leaves are vividly colored and look life-like, reinvigorating the landscaping of your lawn or garden. You can use them inside your home or outside on your porch, patio or deck for decoration that’s easy to care for. The bottom of this tree is weighted to withstand wind and the elements in outdoor spaces while also being light enough to be moved between spaces, and the leaves are UV resistant to remain colorfast. If you’re using this plant indoors, the leaves wipe clean with a soft, damp cloth when needed. You can use them to add greenery to your deck, pool or patio and add natural looking decoration indoors. SATISFACTION - Pure Garden is committed to providing the consumer with the absolute best price and value on our entire line of products, which we ensure by applying a rigorous quality control process. NOTE: This is an exclusive product of Pure Garden and ONLY Hedyotis Topiaries by Pure Garden are to be genuine IMPORTANT: Avoid buying counterfeit products and transacting with unauthorized sellers. Look for our logo on the packaging for every one of our products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81TrmmbsUNL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Stalwart","source_asin":"B00HXGSX5S","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026648","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00HXGSX5S","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00HXGSX5S","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026649,"name":"Halloween Basilisk Venom Color Changing Wizard Magic Potion, Basil Venom, Wizard Decoration Glass Bottle, Apothecary Vial,Horcruxes","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PmAaMAxzL._AC_SL1218_.jpg","description":"Basilism venom now in stock at TheDarknessUnicorn' Apothecary! Don't forget to take the antidote! Careful: - These vials serve as decoration and do not drink! - Do not leave young children within reach (parental supervision required). - Do not leave a heat source close to it so as not to alter its content. - The potions being handmade they can not all look like perfection (slightly different shade of the liquid compared to the photo)! But we're doing the best we can! Imperfection gives more authenticity to our potions and since none of them look the same you have a unique creation! The bottle has been sealed with waterproof glue and sealed with wax. The label was designed by me. A snake charm hangs on the bottle, which is also used as a ring. Bottle sizes Height 16 cm Width 20 cm Story Looking a Basilisk directly in the eye causes instant death, but an indirect look will merely render the victim Petrified. It is also the mortal enemy of spiders, who can intuitively sense them and flee whenever they do. Petrification was a malign magical state in which a living creature was rendered immobile and unresponsive, as if they had been turned to stone. It was a phenomenon of the most advanced Dark Magic,affecting beasts, beings and even spirits such as ghosts. Petrification could be inflicted by the Statue curse, along with the gazes of the Gorgon and the Basilisk. In the case of the Basilisk, its gaze ordinarily killed living creatures, but when seen indirectly, or by a ghost (who is already dead and cannot die again),it caused petrification instead.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61PmAaMAxzL._AC_SL1218_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"TeknooShoping","source_asin":"B09GF4VKC6","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026649","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09GF4VKC6","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09GF4VKC6","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
