window.products.push({"id":1026667,"name":"Lwenki Key Holder for Wall, Key Rack with 4 Key Hooks to Hang Keyrings, Dog Leash, Umbrella, Sunglasses – Key Hanger with Mounting Hardware for Glass,","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":10.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c+qBtuCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Keep Often-Used Items at Hand Provide a central locale for car keys, ID lanyards, sunglasses and dog leashes with this wall mount key holder by Lwenki. Installed near the front door or in your kitchen or mud room, it ends the needless search for commonly-used items. Hang-up scarves, light jackets and travel umbrellas so you are always ready for adverse weather; or organize dog leashes and sunglasses for those times when Fido insists on a last-minute walk. Whatever items your family relies on most, the Lwenki Entryway Key Holder holds them for fast, easy retrieval. Lwenki Does the Heavy Lifting Rival key hooks for hanging keys can sustain only 10 lbs of weight but this aluminum key and dog leash holder for wall supports up to 20 lbs of household accessories. Available in your choice of a black key holder for wall or white key holder for wall, its minimalist look makes it suitable for home, office, retail and industrial use. Sort keys for family cars, organize small keys for locking file cabinets at work, or make machinery accessible to all employees with our wall keyholders. It can even hold wrenches and other small tools in repair shops. No task is too big or too small. Get Organized at Once Everything you need for installing the Lwenki Small Key Holder for wall is included in this kit. It comes with 3 drywall anchors, 3 concrete anchors, 3 screws and 2 finishing caps. Also included is a 2-way strip that transforms the Lwenki Key Hanger into an adhesive key holder for wall and glass mounting. Using our easy-to-follow instruction guide, install your hanging key holder in minutes and get your household on-track for less frustration and more time-saving efficiency. Keep your household running smoothly and efficiently. Add the Lwenki Key Ring Holder for wall to your home and apartment essentials today.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51c+qBtuCrL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Lwenki","source_asin":"B0B2KCWLCQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026667","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0B2KCWLCQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0B2KCWLCQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
