window.products.push({"id":1026743,"name":"Shake Awake Vibrating Portable Travel Clock","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31naXLF2+3L._AC_.jpg","description":"Vibrating alarm clock shake awake is a unique and revolutionary invention that was originally designed for the people who are deaf. This travel alarm clocks are used by the tourist, married couples, college student etc. This bedside alarm are great for patients that need to take medications during the night. This audible alarm is used daily by deaf and hard-of-hearing persons.The intense pulsating vibration from this vibrating alarm will awaken even the deepest sleeper when it is time to take the medications or just wake up. Just place this vibrating alarm wake up alarm clock \"inside your pillowcase\" or in your pocket. This wake up alarm travel clock can be set for sound alarm. The snooze function of this vibration alarm can be turned on or off. This travel alarm clock is a perfect traveling companion.The shake awake travel alarm clock wakes you with a subtle but powerful vibration. Battery Type: AAA & 2-AA","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31naXLF2+3L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Shake Awake","source_asin":"B00012BZQA","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026743","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B00012BZQA","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B00012BZQA","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026744,"name":"Greensboro Lunch Counter Sit-in at Woolworth's 11x14 Silver Halide Photo Print","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Az0o45agL._AC_.jpg","description":"This museum grade traditional silver halide photograph is MADE IN THE USA directly from The McMahan Photo Archive's copyrighted full resolution restored originals.PHOTO DESCRIPTIONThe Greensboro sit-ins of 1960 began with four young men (Joseph McNeil, Franklin McCain, Ezell A. Blair, Jr. and David L. Richmond) who refused to leave the \"whites-only\" lunch counter at Woolworth's, thereby inspiring similar sit-in protests.PHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Jack Moebes / UPI / RMP Archive / The McMahan Photo ArchivePHOTOGRAPHER / CREDIT: Copyright, The McMahan Photo Archive/RMP Archive PHOTO IMAGE DATE: February 1960IMAGE ID: NA487ABOUT OUR PHOTOGRAPHSThe McMahan Photo Archive mixes the best of today's print and restoration technologies with old fashioned hard work and artistry. People make the artistic decisions, not computers. We have printed over a million real light exposed and chemical processed silver halide prints since our start in 2001. What you are buying here is a REAL PHOTOGRAPH! At The McMahan Photo Art Gallery & Archive, you are always buying the best!Every order is backed by our 365 Day 100% RAVING FAN GUARANTEE! If your print isn't perfect, we will make it right or accept a return for a full refund. We really want you to be one of our raving fans!Robert McMahanFounder, Photographer, Historic Photo Print Expert","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Az0o45agL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The McMahan Photo Archive","source_asin":"B072HNJLR4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026744","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B072HNJLR4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B072HNJLR4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
