window.products.push({"id":1026824,"name":"Joyreap 3-Piece Fluffy Faux Fur Sherpa Comforter Set Pink, Twin Size Luxury Tufted Bedding Comforter Set, Ultra Soft Warm Cold Weather Plush Comforter","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SC5w3+TiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Faux Fur,plush,sherpa Twin Size is a 3-Piece Set Contains One Comforter (68\"x86\") and Two Pillow Shams (20\"x26\"). If you want a comforter that drapes to the floor, you may choose a larger size. Soft & Fluffy- A side of the comforter is ultra soft tufted faux fur plush polyster, B side is fluffy warm sherpa. Both sides are made of nice thermal ability material, giving you exceptionally soft and milky feeling, help you keep warm in the cold winter. WHOLE-PIECE Microfiber Filling: We use a whole piece of premium and well-distributed polyester as the filling of the comforter. Therefore, it is warmer and more durable than normal all-season comforters. Perfect for families with pets or children. Easy Care & Durable: Machine wash cold on gentle cycle, tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach to keep the color vibrant. (Washing before first use is recommended). Vacuum Packed: The product may looks flat when taking out, you can tap it gently to increase the fluffiness. Spreading it flat on the bed or hanging in the sun for a while both helps restore the comforter. If you have any question, pls feel free to contact us.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81SC5w3+TiL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Joyreap","source_asin":"B0BCJDFD8B","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026824","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BCJDFD8B","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BCJDFD8B","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026825,"name":"Personalized Dinosaur Blanket for Boys, Jurassic Dinosaurs Gift Blankets for Adult, Custom Blanket with Name, Super Soft Dino Throw Blanket for Dinosa","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":29.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8196u4GTZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Super soft and cozy material: We take the softness and comfort of blankets seriously! This will be your new favorite blanket or the best gift you've ever given.This personalized dinosaur blankets high grade 100 percent premium microfiber polyester, which has good anti-wrinkle and shape retention, durable, breathable and lightweight, the material is skin-friendly and comfortable, Keeps you warm. Personalized dinosaur blanket: Click 'Customize Now' to start having fun designing a custom dinosaur blanket. Enter name, Customize Unique Souvenirs.this blanket a unique memory maker for both parents and child for years to come. show your unique love for him or her, and warm him throughout his life. Unique personalized gifts: What's better than a custom gift? A custom blanket with name/text is a great gift for your baby, son, daughter, grandson, nephew, niece,dinosaur lover and more. You can use the blanket as a Newborn Gift/Birthday Gift/Christmas Gift/Valentine's Day Gift/Mother's Day Gift/Family Gift/Graduation Gift/Wedding Gift, suitable for all occasions and crowds. Versatile: Multi-size blanket, suitable for all groups, you can use it as newborn swaddle blanket, toddler bed blanket, baby shower blanket, sofa blanket; light and easy to carry, can also be used as travel blanket, camping blanket, beach blanket, picnic blanket;Suitable for all seasons. Washing and after-sales service: Machine washable and tumble dry on low, do not bleach. If you have any questions and dissatisfaction with our products, please leave us a message, we will give you a satisfactory answer and service within 24 hours.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/8196u4GTZ8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"J&SBGFT","source_asin":"B0BQB56VZQ","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026825","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BQB56VZQ","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BQB56VZQ","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
