window.products.push({"id":1026837,"name":"Handmade Washcloths in 100 percent cotton, in pleasing earth tone shades .Available in sets of 2,3 or 4! (Set of 2)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711JQIcIWoS._SL1500_.jpg","description":"These are 100% cotton hand knitted dishcloth or washcloths. Saw these selling well on ebay at this price and decided to give it a try. They are knitted in an appealing blend of cream and earth tone colors in a cute diagonal pattern. This order is for a set of 2 individual washcloths. Cotton fibers make great cleaning material. 7 inches by 7 inches. The cloth has a bit of a scrubbing surface and it rinses out nicely. Machine wash, do not bleach.. and colors of cotton may fade over time.. (you can dry in dryer, I use California Sun)","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/711JQIcIWoS._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Generic","source_asin":"B097CXBDDN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026837","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B097CXBDDN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B097CXBDDN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026838,"name":"Syntus 12 Pack Bib Apron, Unisex Aprons Adjustable Waterdrop Resistant with 2 Pockets Cooking Kitchen Apron for Chef, BBQ Drawing Apron Bulk, Black","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":25.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c1uS3TYdL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"Note: 1. Wash with dark colored cloth. 2. Bleaching, dry cleaning and tumble drying are NOT allowed. 3. The material only repel water under normal temperature but not hot liquid and oil. 4. Aprons may get wet when hit by a large amount of water splash. So it's NOT 100% WATERPROOF. 5. There may be a tiny location hole above the pockets used to exactly locate for sewing by machine which will not affect the appearance and performance of product. Description Look like a master chef in Syntus adjustable Black bib apron. It's in unique design with an adjustable neck strap for the most suitable length. Comes with a long ties that can be easily altered to fit most sizes. It covers from chest to knee provides great coverage and protection from kitchen grease, spills and food stains.  Machine-washable, resists wrinkles and shrinkage. 2 large pockets in the middle of apron for easy holding meat thermometer, grill slips, recipe cards, etc. Soft to touch, made from polyester fiber and free from harmful chemicals, safe for you & your family.  Setting 12 pieces in total, which is convenient to change and wash. Besides, if you are a restaurant manager or party organizer, this apron is a great choice for you. Package Content 12 *Syntus Bib Apron","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61c1uS3TYdL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Syntus","source_asin":"B08V4YF5WN","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026838","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08V4YF5WN","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08V4YF5WN","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
