window.products.push({"id":1026959,"name":"Pampas Grass Black Dried Natural Large 4 Stems 45 inch Tall Fluffy Dried Pampas Big Plants for Boho Home Decor Flower Arrangements Faux Flowers Weddin","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yR7l1XSXL._AC_.jpg","description":"Your search for the perfect Pampas Grass ends here! At MarneyAsh, we've selected the most beautiful and fluffiest plumes (feather part) for you to enjoy! Specifications 4 stems; 43\" - 45\" Pampas grass 4 stems; 43\" - 45\" Pampas grass Pampas grass large feathery plumes measure 2.5 - 2.9 ft Pampas grass large feathery plumes measure 2.5 - 2.9 ft 100% natural, premium, extra fluffy, tall 100% natural, premium, extra fluffy, tall Perfect stem height to fit a tall vase. Perfect stem height to fit a tall vase. Color- Our dried pampas grass are a sophisticated black. Color- Our dried pampas grass are a sophisticated black. Room Decor Pampas Grass decor is perfect for natural home decor. Large pampas grass gives a fresh flower plant look to modern and chic homes. They are a must-have alongside your luxury boho decorations. Tall pampas grass is perfect in a floor vase and table boho vase. Our dried pampas grass decor brings warmth to boho kitchen decor, mantle decor, living room decor and bedroom decor. Wedding Decor Pampas grass arrangements for weddings are trending. A Pampas grass floral arrangement is perfect for decorative wedding flowers, dried grass wedding arches, pampas grass wreaths, bridal bouquets and DIY creative crafts. Pampas grass large flower arrangements give a rustic and romantic look to a bohemian wedding, beach wedding, and farmhouse wedding. Pampas flower decor is great for all events. Before Use The elegant dried flower will compress in packaging, but will regain the fluffy feather look. To optimize the fluffy pampas grass plumes, place the dried pampas grass large stems in the sun up to 24hrs. Use a blow dryer to fluff the natural pampas grass. Give the pampas grass time to air out. Pampas grass dried stems are delicate. Care Dried grasses for decor don't need any water.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41yR7l1XSXL._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"MarneyAsh","source_asin":"B092LRZ3JS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026959","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B092LRZ3JS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B092LRZ3JS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
