window.products.push({"id":1026968,"name":"Big Dot of Happiness Sweet 16-16th Birthday Party Water Bottle Sticker Labels - Set of 20","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k6wTLPSFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Sweet 16 Water Bottle Sticker Labels INCLUDES 20 DIY water bottle labels. Sweet 16 DIY party supplies are perfect for quickly dressing up any beverage bottle in your party theme. Water bottle stickers each SIZE 8.5\" wide x 2\" tall, perfect for any beverage bottle or container less than 8.5\" in diameter. EASY TO USE: Prepare your water bottles or containers by ensuring they are room temperature and dry. Removing the original bottle label is preferred but not necessary. Carefully peel one Sweet 16 sticker label from the backing and adhere to a bottle, starting at the middle and pressing toward edge. Smooth label around container and chill your beverages if needed. HIGH QUALITY PARTY SUPPLIES: Sweet 16 water bottle labels are professionally printed on a sticker paper with a glossy coating. They are waterproof and can be used on beverages that will be chilled, just be sure to apply prior to chilling. Add them to a 16th birthday party beverage bar for an impressive, coordinated display. UNIQUE BEVERAGE BAR: Sweet 16 Water Bottle Labels will make coordinated beverage area at your birthday party. Add Sweet 16 Water Bottle Labels to standard water bottles, mini water bottles, soda bottles and single-serving juice containers. Water bottle labels can also be used on cylinder containers to create Sweet 16 centerpieces. MADE IN THE USA: Sweet 16 - 16th Birthday Party Water Bottle Sticker Labels are designed and manufactured at our Wisconsin facility using materials that are Made in America. Please Note: Beverages in image are not included. Water Bottle Labels No-Mess Glitter Print: Our beverage labels are designed with a printed image of glitter, eliminating glitter flake while maximizing bling effect!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61k6wTLPSFL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Big Dot of Happiness","source_asin":"B07LCRZRJ8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026968","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07LCRZRJ8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07LCRZRJ8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":1026969,"name":"HASMX 301291 Vacuum Cleaner Belts for Kirby Upright Vacuum Cleaner G3 G4 G5 G7D Ultimate Diamond Sentria, Replaces Part Number 301291, Black (5-Pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":12.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610SpK-jdJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"HASMX 301291 Vacuum Cleaner Belts for Kirby Upright Vacuum Cleaner G3 G4 G5 G7D Ultimate Diamond Sentria, Replaces Part Number 301291, Black (5-Pack) Color: Black.  Type: Vacuum Belts.  Compatible Brand: for Kirby.  Application:Vacuum Cleaner.  Replaces Part Number: 301291.  Compatible Models: for Kirby G3, G4, G5, G7D, Ultimate Diamond, Sentria.  Compatible for the following Kirby Upright Vacuums: Heritage (all) Classic (all) Tradition (all) Legend (all) Generation 3, 4, 5, 6 Ultimate (G7) Diamond (G7D) Sentria (G10) Sentria II  One of the quickest and least expensive ways to improve the performance of your vacuum cleaner is to replace your belts frequently. If your vacuum utilizes a flat or friction style belt, the belt will continually stretch over time.  If you wait until your belt breaks before you replace it, you may notice a decrease in performance. Many people attribute this to a loss of suction; it is actually caused by the stretched belt being unable to spin your brush roll at optimal speed. Also, changing your belt will make your vacuum cleaner easier to push, because as the brush roll spins faster, it will aid you as you push it across your carpeting.  Package Includes: 5 x Vacuum Belts (as the picture shows).  Every Product from HASMX will enjoy 30 days Money-back and 18-Months worry-free warranty.  If you're not sure whether it fits your model, please email us-includes your Models and serial number.  Note - This is an aftermarket replacement Parts. Any brand name is used solely for the purpose of demonstrating compatibility.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/610SpK-jdJL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"HASMX","source_asin":"B08P7DPY7L","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-1026969","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08P7DPY7L","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08P7DPY7L","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
